1 NOTE {geni:about_me} in family picture of abt 1913 in Illinois. It shows a picture of Ed Askeland with family of his uncle Ray Askland. Info from family shows Ed coming to USA in 1915. Wonder if was first in USA in 1913 and returned to
2 CONC  Norway. Coming back to USA in 1915????
2 CONT
2 CONT lived farm #3 s¿re Askeland arrived from Norway to Halifax, Canada on 15, Mar 1915. He traveled to Thor Iowa. First stayed on farm in Iowa owned by Ingolf Sorlie.
2 CONT
2 CONT applied for USA citizenship 5 Feb, 1925, in Humboldt County, Iowa
2 CONT
2 CONT obit: Eliseus (Ed) Askeland, 86, former longtime Saturday at the Rotary Ann Home, Eagle Grove. Services were held Monday at 2pm at the Thor Lutheran Church, with burial in East Ullansvang Cemetery, Thor. Kasler-Babcock-Deyong , wa
2 CONC s in charge. Surviving are the widow, Edna; sons elmer Askeland and Oscar Askeland, both of Fort Dodge; daughters, Mrs Ben Wooster, Eagle Grove; Mrs Lee Eaton, Denver, Colo, Mrs Raymond Orsland, Thor, Mrs Milton Welch, Denver, Col
2 CONC o; Mrs Ed Edgerton, San Diego, Calif; 26 grandchildren; brothers Albert and Severin both of Milford; Bert, Norway; and sister Anna Baerheim, Norway. Mr. Askeland was born in Norway and attended school there. He came to USA in 1916
2 CONC . He married Edna Askland of Humboldt at Julesburg, Colo. in 1918 and they farmed in the Thor Humboldt and Badger areas. They moved to Thor in 1960, and to the Rotary Ann Home in Eagle Grove to make there home in 1973.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1920 Federal Census, Rutland Twp, Humboldt County, IA Askeland, Ed, head, age 30, immigrate 1915 Askeland, Edna, wife, age 22 Askeland, Sarah, dau, Askeland, Helen, dau
2 CONT
2 CONT 1930 Federal Census, Beaver Twp, Humboldt County, IA Askeland, Ed, farmer, age 40, immigrated 1914 Askeland, Edna, wife, age 32 Askeland, Sarah, dau, age 11 Askeland, Helen, dau, age 10 Askeland, Elmer, son, age 9 Askeland, Mary. 
2 CONC dau, age 7 Askeland, Levi. son, age 6 Askeland, Agnes, dau, age 4 Askeland, Oscar, son, ge 3 Askeland, John, nephew, age 20, immigrated 1929
2 CONT
