2 CONT
2 CONT George Kamplain BIRTH	30 Apr 1918 Flat Rock, Crawford County, Illinois, USA DEATH	17 Jun 2013 (aged 95) Danville, Vermilion County, Illinois, USA BURIAL	 Pontoppidan Cemetery Elliott, Ford County, Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT George Kamplain, 95, of Danville died at 7 a.m. Monday (June 17, 2013) at Colonial Manor Nursing Home, Danville.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born April 30, 1918 in Crawford County, Flat Rock, Illinois to George Frank and Lena D. Wesley Kamplain. He married Hazel O. Hanson June 8, 1946 in Decatur. She preceded him in death January 30, 1995. He was also preceded i
2 CONC n death by his parents; two brothers, five sisters, one daughter-in-law and a son-in-law.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by two sons, Wesley(Joyce) Kamplain and Gary (Mary) Kamplain; one daughter, Kathie Kamplain; eight grandchildren; 11 great grandchildren; one brother, John (Joyce) Kamplain and two sisters, Ruby Baker and Rosy Mitch
2 CONC ell.
2 CONT
