2 CONT Clifford Cameron BIRTH	4 Dec 1927 Trowbridge, Shelby County, Illinois, USA DEATH	4 Sep 2009 (aged 81) Springfield, Sangamon County, Illinois, USA BURIAL	 Woodlawn Cemetery Urbana, Champaign County, Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Clifford Cameron, 81, of Champaign passed away at 2 p.m. Friday, September 4, 2009, at Memorial Medical Center in Springfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born to Edward Oliver Cameron and Nora Ann Quicksall Cameron in Trowbridge, Il. He married Opal Teresa Hanson on May 6, 1950, in Paxton, Il. She survives.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also surviving are one daughter, EllenSue Cameron of Champaign; two granddaughters, Michelle Ann Buchanan Haussermann and her husband, Mark, of Lake Forest and Natalie Sue Buchanan Rajcevich and her husband, Mark, of Geneva, Ill.;
2 CONC  four great-grandchildren, Timothy Cameron Haussermann, Evan Shapland Haussermann and twins Ashley Kendall Rajcevich and Cameron Lily Rajcevich and one sister, Vera Cameron Cannon of Champaign.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was preceded in death by his parents, four brothers and four sisters.
