1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial record:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/119118058/eva-mildred-ostrem
2 CONT
2 CONT Eva Ostrem, age 95, of Radcliffe, IA, died on Sunday, October 20, 2013 at the Hubbard Care Center in Hubbard.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services will be held on Thursday, October 24, at 10:30 am at Our Savior's Lutheran Church in Radcliffe, IA. Eva will be buried at Radcliffe Cemetery. Visitation will be held at Our Savior's Lutheran Church in Radcliffe, I
2 CONC A, on Wednesday, October 23, from 5:00 to 7:00 pm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Those thankful for having shared her life include one daughter Joyce Ostrem of Richfield, MN, five sons Eldon (Sharon) of Ankeny, Steve (Linda) of Stratford, Karl (Rhonda) of Story City, Denny (Tracy) of Marshalltown, and Douglas 
2 CONC (Lori) of Story City; 13 grandchildren; 16 great-grandchildren; 1 great-great-granddaughter; sisters-in-law Marjorie Stensland, Norma Ostrem and Donna Ostrem; and a brother-in-law Kenneth Bauge; along with many other relatives and
2 CONC  friends.
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorials may be directed to the family. Boeke Funeral Home of Hubbard is in charge of arrangements.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------
