1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1910 Federal Census South Grove Twsp, DeKalb Co., IL Askland, Ray 43 yrs mar once for 16 yrs b. Nor imm 1887 farmer Askland, Hannah 35 yrs mar once for 16 yrs mo of 7 all living b. Nor imm 1890 Askland, Henry son 1
2 CONC 5 yrs b. IL Askland, Edna dau 12 yrs b. IL Askland, Helen dau 10 yrs b. IL Askland, Ray son 7 yrs b. IL Askland, Arthur son 5 yrs b. IL Askland, Alice 2 yrs b. IL S. Grove Twsp, DeKalb Co. Askland, Charles son 1/12 mos b. IL pb. N
2 CONC or
