1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/206810991/sally-k.-kamplain
2 CONT
2 CONT Sally K. Kamplain, 54, of Danville, Illinois, mother of a Peoria man, died at 7:58 p.m. Thursday, May 20, 2004, in the Provena USMC Logan Campus emergency room in Danville.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born Oct. 30, 1949, in Danville to Harry C. and Bessie Seal Hummer, she married Lloyd "Wes" Kamplain on Feb. 23, 1969, in Danville. He survives.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also surviving are her mother of Danville; one son, Greg (and Deborah) of Peoria; one daughter, Amy Kamplain of Danville and one sister, Lillian (and James) McKillop of Longview, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her father.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cremation will be accorded.
2 CONT
2 CONT Peoria Journal Star, The (IL) - Tuesday, May 25, 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse
2 CONT
2 CONT Lloyd Wesley Kamplain 1947–2020 (m. 1969)
